      en: ["Highest peak Pyrgari reaches 1,109 meters.", "Source of the marble used for the Parthenon and Acropolis.", "Features the Davelis Cave, an ancient religious site.", "Monastery of Penteli was established here in 1578.", "Ancient quarries are now designated as protected monuments.", "Provides panoramic views of Athens and the Euboean Gulf."],
