      en: ["Elevation: 1,433 m", "Island: Samos", "Rock: Marble", "Type: Extinct volcano"],
      es: ["Altitud: 1433 m", "Isla: Samos", "Roca: Mármol", "Tipo: Volcán extinguido"],
